CREOracleScheduleFuzz
├── An unset snapshot remains unavailable even when its zero timestamp is within the age bound
├── Bootstrap accepts a fresh completed snapshot without changing its timestamp
├── Each accepted snapshot must advance both its block and timestamp
├── A delayed report and a newer completed snapshot can arrive at the same timestamp
├── Every new snapshot second can be accepted
├── Maximum uint48 timestamps do not require computing a future cutoff
└── Snapshot ABI words above uint48 are rejected before acceptance
